  "details": "When you're waiting to join a group instance you might be distracted and miss the indicator that your instance is ready, and then it will expire before you get to it. This is a request for an option to have a dialog pop up when your instance is ready that forces you to either join the instance or leave queue.\n\nSomething like...\n\n\"Your instance is now ready to join and will expire in: XXs\" [join] [leave queue]",
